ANNIVERSARY OF D-DAY, ELIZABETH

00:00:09.447 --> 00:00:11.114
WARREN SAID CLIMATE CHANGE IS A

00:00:11.115 --> 00:00:11.848
BIGGER THREAT THAN WHATEVER

00:00:11.849 --> 00:00:13.083
