00:00:13.084 --> 00:00:15.919
&gt;&gt; AMERICANS FACE HUGE

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.722
CHALLENGES BEFORE.

00:00:18.723 --> 00:00:19.155
WORLD WAR II.

00:00:19.156 --> 00:00:21.157
PUT A MAN ON THE MOON.

00:00:21.158 --> 00:00:23.693
THIS ENVIRONMENTAL CATASTROPHE

00:00:23.694 --> 00:00:28.031
BEARING DOWN ON US MAY BE THE

00:00:28.032 --> 00:00:30.700
BIGGEST CHALLENGE YET.

00:00:30.701 --> 00:00:31.234
&gt;&gt; Greg: BIGGER THAN

00:00:31.235 --> 00:00:31.668
WORLD WAR II.

00:00:31.669 --> 00:00:32.736
IMAGINE IF SHE HAD BEEN

00:00:32.737 --> 00:00:34.237
PRESIDENT ON D-DAY.

00:00:34.238 --> 00:00:35.105
LET'S CALL IT OFF.

00:00:35.106 --> 00:00:36.439
THE SEA HORSES MIGHT DIE.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:38.341
SHE WOULD PUT THE WHOLE THING ON

00:00:38.342 --> 00:00:39.609
HOLD UNTIL THEY FIX THE MISSIONS

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:40.577
IN THE SHERMAN TANKS.

00:00:40.578 --> 00:00:42.712
CLIMATE CHANGE IS WORSE THAN

00:00:42.713 --> 00:00:43.046
HITLER?

00:00:43.047 --> 00:00:44.281
COULD BE SINCE JUST THE THOUGHT

00:00:44.282 --> 00:00:45.282
MAKES ME FEEL.

00:00:45.283 --> 00:00:46.516
AFTER GETTING HAMMERED FOR

00:00:46.517 --> 00:00:47.817
APPROPRIATING NATIVE

00:00:47.818 --> 00:00:48.685
AMERICANISM, LIZ WANTS TO BE

00:00:48.686 --> 00:00:49.553
AOC.

00:00:49.554 --> 00:00:51.221
AS THE OTHER DEMOCRATS REALIZE

00:00:51.222 --> 00:00:59.930
THAT BLAMING HER FOR EVERYTHING

00:00:59.931 --> 00:01:00.630
IN GOOD TIMES IS ESSENTIALLY

00:01:00.631 --> 00:01:01.298
CREDITING HIM FOR THE GOOD

00:01:01.299 --> 00:01:01.598
TIMES.

00:01:01.599 --> 00:01:02.332
NOW IT'S BACK TO CLIMATE DOOM.

00:01:02.333 --> 00:01:02.999
BUT IF THEY BELIEVE WE WILL

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:03.700
DESTROY EARTH IF WE DON'T ACT

00:01:03.701 --> 00:01:04.434
DRASTICALLY SHOULDN'T THEY BE

00:01:04.435 --> 00:01:05.135
DISABLING PLANES, TRAINS, AND

00:01:05.136 --> 00:01:05.835
AUTOMOBILES INSTEAD OF USING

00:01:05.836 --> 00:01:07.404
THEM?

00:01:07.405 --> 00:01:07.871
WHAT HYPOCRITES.

00:01:07.872 --> 00:01:09.439
NY BROKEN RECORDS.

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:10.640
APOCALYPTIC THINKING HAS BEEN

00:01:10.641 --> 00:01:11.107
AROUND FOREVER.

00:01:11.108 --> 00:01:13.877
THE WORLD WAS SUPPOSED TO END ON

00:01:13.878 --> 00:01:14.878
A MILLION YESTERDAYS.

00:01:14.879 --> 00:01:16.246
YET THE LEFT KEEPS RESURRECTING

00:01:16.247 --> 00:01:17.647
THAT ONE THOUGHT: WE ARE ALL

00:01:17.648 --> 00:01:18.648
GOING TO DIE.

00:01:18.649 --> 00:01:19.883
IT RAISES A HUGE QUESTION.

00:01:19.884 --> 00:01:21.885
IF THE LEFT CAN'T COME UP WITH A

00:01:21.886 --> 00:01:24.521
WAY TO SOLVE TERROR, CRIME, OR

00:01:24.522 --> 00:01:25.622
HOMELESSNESS, WHY SHOULD WE

00:01:25.623 --> 00:01:27.257
LISTEN TO THEM ABOUT A PROBLEM

00:01:27.258 --> 00:01:30.026
THAT'S THE SIZE OF THE EARTH?

00:01:30.027 --> 00:01:31.094
THERE WERE 144,000 ARRESTS ON

00:01:31.095 --> 00:01:31.861
THE SOUTHERN BORDER LAST MONTH.

00:01:31.862 --> 00:01:34.397
YOU DON'T WANT TO SOLVE THAT

00:01:34.398 --> 00:01:34.864
LITTLE PROBLEM?

00:01:34.865 --> 00:01:35.932
THEN I WOULD SHUT UP ABOUT THE

00:01:35.933 --> 00:01:36.299
EARTH.

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:38.702
YOU ARE IN OVER YOUR HEAD.

00:01:38.703 --> 00:01:39.436
ISSUES ARE ALWAYS HAMPERED BY

00:01:39.437 --> 00:01:40.804
HYSTERIA SPECIALNESS DELIVERED

00:01:40.805 --> 00:01:42.472
LIKE A CHAMP FROM A DOOMSDAY

00:01:42.473 --> 00:01:42.772
CULT.

00:01:42.773 --> 00:01:44.140
CLIMATE CHANGE MAY BE AN

00:01:44.141 --> 00:01:45.909
EXISTENTIAL THREAT BUT ONLY TO

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:49.479
THE SANITY OF DEMOCRATS.

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:50.647
YOU KNOW, KENNEDY, THE DEMOCRATS

00:01:50.648 --> 00:01:52.015
COULD'VE SOLVED IMMIGRATION IN A

00:01:52.016 --> 00:01:53.483
LUNCH HOUR BUT COULDN'T.

00:01:53.484 --> 00:01:55.118
I GUESS CLIMATE CHANGES EASIER.

00:01:55.119 --> 00:01:55.852
&gt;&gt; Kennedy: IT'S EASIER

00:01:55.853 --> 00:01:57.754
BECAUSE ALL YOU HAVE TO DO IS

00:01:57.755 --> 00:01:59.990
TAKE A BUNCH OF MONEY FROM

00:01:59.991 --> 00:02:02.292
PEOPLE AND IT'S JUST ANOTHER

00:02:02.293 --> 00:02:05.662
REDISTRIBUTION SCHEME.

00:02:05.663 --> 00:02:07.364
ELIZABETH WARREN ONLY HAS ONE

00:02:07.365 --> 00:02:08.898
WAY OF TAKING MONEY FROM RICH

00:02:08.899 --> 00:02:09.232
PEOPLE.

00:02:09.233 --> 00:02:10.533
THERE'S ONLY ONE MECHANISM FOR

00:02:10.534 --> 00:02:10.934
DOING THAT.

00:02:10.935 --> 00:02:17.040
YET IT'S ALMOST LIKE A BADLY RUN

00:02:17.041 --> 00:02:17.807
PONZI SCHEME.

00:02:17.808 --> 00:02:19.209
SHE IS TAKING THAT MONEY FROM

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:20.443
THE RICH PEOPLE BUT SHE'S

00:02:20.444 --> 00:02:22.078
PROMISING IT TO ABOUT FIVE

00:02:22.079 --> 00:02:22.979
DIFFERENT PROGRAMS.

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:24.814
WITH NO NEW REVENUE STREAMS.

00:02:24.815 --> 00:02:25.482
THERE'S ONE CENTRAL REVENUE

00:02:25.483 --> 00:02:27.917
STREAM BUT SHE'S GOING TO USE

00:02:27.918 --> 00:02:30.587
THAT TO PAY FOR COLLEGE AND

00:02:30.588 --> 00:02:33.023
UNIVERSAL PRE-K AND PAY FOR ALL

00:02:33.024 --> 00:02:34.658
SORTS OF CHILD CARE AFTER THE

00:02:34.659 --> 00:02:35.825
AGE OF FIVE.

00:02:35.826 --> 00:02:36.526
AND SHE'S GOING TO SOCK IT TO

00:02:36.527 --> 00:02:39.095
RICH PEOPLE ONE TIME.

00:02:39.096 --> 00:02:40.063
AND ALSO HAVE A $5 TRILLION

00:02:40.064 --> 00:02:43.199
CLIMATE CHANGE PLAN THAT PICKS

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:44.501
WINNERS AND LOSERS THAT WILL

00:02:44.502 --> 00:02:46.302
MAGICALLY SOMEHOW NOT BE CORRUPT

00:02:46.303 --> 00:02:48.204
AT ALL WITH A BRAND-NEW

00:02:48.205 --> 00:02:48.605
BUREAUCRACY.

00:02:48.606 --> 00:02:49.239
&gt;&gt; Greg: JESSE, I HAVE A

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:50.607
THEORY.

00:02:50.608 --> 00:02:51.908
WOULD YOU LIKE TO HEAR IT?

00:02:51.909 --> 00:02:53.476
I THINK THE DEMOCRATS ARE PRETTY

00:02:53.477 --> 00:02:56.012
GOOD AT IDENTIFYING PROBLEMS.

00:02:56.013 --> 00:02:56.880
IT'S THE REPUBLICANS WOULD HAVE

00:02:56.881 --> 00:02:58.248
TO SOLVE THEM.

00:02:58.249 --> 00:02:58.848
WHEN YOU DON'T HAVE THE

00:02:58.849 --> 00:03:00.283
REPUBLICANS THERE, YOU END UP

00:03:00.284 --> 00:03:02.652
WITH HOMELESSNESS IN L.A. COUNTY

00:03:02.653 --> 00:03:03.920
SO YOU CAN SAY THERE'S

00:03:03.921 --> 00:03:04.587
HOMELESSNESS BUT YOU AREN'T

00:03:04.588 --> 00:03:06.322
INCLUDING THE PEOPLE THAT CAN

00:03:06.323 --> 00:03:07.757
ACTUALLY SOLVE THE PROBLEMS

00:03:07.758 --> 00:03:08.425
WHICH IS THE PRIVATE SECTOR.

00:03:08.426 --> 00:03:10.627
&gt;&gt; Jesse: I WOULD SAY THE

00:03:10.628 --> 00:03:11.961
DEMOCRATS CREATE THE PROBLEMS,

00:03:11.962 --> 00:03:12.896
BLAME THE REPUBLICANS, AND THEN

00:03:12.897 --> 00:03:15.665
SAY ELECT ME AND I WILL FIX THE

00:03:15.666 --> 00:03:16.700
PROBLEM I CREATED.

00:03:16.701 --> 00:03:17.834
I HAVE ANOTHER THEORY.

00:03:17.835 --> 00:03:19.002
THE GREEN NEW DEAL IS JUST A

00:03:19.003 --> 00:03:21.204
SALES PITCH FOR SOCIALISM.

00:03:21.205 --> 00:03:24.641
IF YOU PUT GREEN AND SOMETHING,

00:03:24.642 --> 00:03:27.143
FRONT OF SOMETHING, IT SOUNDS

00:03:27.144 --> 00:03:29.079
BETTER.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.947
AUTOMATICALLY IT MAKES YOU SEEM

00:03:30.948 --> 00:03:31.848
HEALTHIER, MORE SOPHISTICATED,

00:03:31.849 --> 00:03:35.852
MODERN, BETTER.

00:03:35.853 --> 00:03:38.254
IT'S JUST AN EXCUSE TO SPEND

00:03:38.255 --> 00:03:38.555
MORE.

00:03:38.556 --> 00:03:41.658
THEY WANT TO COMPLETE TAKEOVER

00:03:41.659 --> 00:03:42.926
OF THE ECONOMY AND YOUR LIFE AND

00:03:42.927 --> 00:03:44.160
THEY JUSTIFIED BY SAYING WE'RE

00:03:44.161 --> 00:03:46.196
GOING TO SAVE THE WORLD DOING

00:03:46.197 --> 00:03:46.463
IT.

00:03:46.464 --> 00:03:48.131
WHAT REALLY IS HAPPENING IS LIKE

00:03:48.132 --> 00:03:49.466
YOU SENT, TOTAL REDISTRIBUTION.

00:03:49.467 --> 00:03:50.667
WHAT ARE THEY GOING TO DO?

00:03:50.668 --> 00:03:52.135
THEY ARE GOING TO TAKE A

00:03:52.136 --> 00:03:54.104
TRILLION DOLLARS AND THEN

00:03:54.105 --> 00:03:54.871
THEY'RE GOING TO FIX SOME DONOR

00:03:54.872 --> 00:03:57.474
WHO OWNS A WIND FARM AND GIVE

00:03:57.475 --> 00:03:58.508
HIM 5 MILLION.

00:03:58.509 --> 00:03:59.542
THEN THE BIGGEST ALGAE FIRM IN

00:03:59.543 --> 00:04:02.078
HER HOME STATE OF MASSACHUSETTS,

00:04:02.079 --> 00:04:03.580
THEY GET A COUPLE MILLION

00:04:03.581 --> 00:04:03.913
DOLLARS.

00:04:03.914 --> 00:04:05.782
AND THEN THEY GIVE A CONTRACT OF

00:04:05.783 --> 00:04:07.617
THE SOLAR PANEL COMPANY, AND

00:04:07.618 --> 00:04:08.618
THEY RE-OUTFIT THE ENTIRE

00:04:08.619 --> 00:04:10.120
DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE.

00:04:10.121 --> 00:04:12.222
IT'S LIKE SOLYNDRA ON STEROIDS.

00:04:12.223 --> 00:04:13.923
IT'S GREEN GRAFT IS WHAT IT

00:04:13.924 --> 00:04:14.290
REALLY IS.

00:04:14.291 --> 00:04:17.026
ELIZABETH WARREN GETS UP THERE.

00:04:17.027 --> 00:04:18.828
ALL SHE'S DONE IN HER WHOLE

00:04:18.829 --> 00:04:20.764
LIFE, SHE FLIPPED ONE HOUSE FOR

00:04:20.765 --> 00:04:21.898
A SMALL PROFIT AND WROTE A FAKE

00:04:21.899 --> 00:04:23.466
INDIAN COOKBOOK AND YOU'RE GOING

00:04:23.467 --> 00:04:26.002
TO PUT HER IN CHARGE OF A

00:04:26.003 --> 00:04:26.569
$19 TRILLION ECONOMY.

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:32.008
SHE'S NOT WARREN BUFFETT.

00:04:32.009 --> 00:04:33.076
&gt;&gt; Dana: GRAFT DOES NOT SOUND

00:04:33.077 --> 00:04:35.078
BETTER WITH THE WORD GREEN IN

00:04:35.079 --> 00:04:35.512
