00:04:35.513 --> 00:04:37.447
MIGHT BE THE ONLY WORD.

00:04:37.448 --> 00:04:38.848
&gt;&gt; Greg: I HAVE ANOTHER

00:04:38.849 --> 00:04:39.182
THEORY.

00:04:39.183 --> 00:04:42.085
SHOULD I POSIT IT TO YOU OR

00:04:42.086 --> 00:04:42.385
JUAN.

