JUAN, BIDEN IS GETTING HAMMERED

00:04:43.954 --> 00:04:45.255
FOR PLAGIARIZING PARTS OF HIS

00:04:45.256 --> 00:04:45.755
GREEN DEAL.

00:04:45.756 --> 00:04:48.958
I THINK IT WAS A GREAT STRATEGY

00:04:48.959 --> 00:04:50.727
BECAUSE HE GOT PEOPLE TO

00:04:50.728 --> 00:04:51.861
ACTUALLY READ IT.

00:04:51.862 --> 00:04:54.264
YOU HAD TO COMPARE THE PASSAGES.

00:04:54.265 --> 00:04:56.399
IN EFFECT, THEIR MEDIA READ IT

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:57.300
TWICE.

00:04:57.301 --> 00:04:58.034
&gt;&gt; Juan: THAT'S GOOD POINT.

00:04:58.035 --> 00:05:00.703
YOU KNOW WHAT I THINK, TO ME,

00:05:00.704 --> 00:05:04.340
IT'S INCREDIBLE BUT YOU SAID IT

00:05:04.341 --> 00:05:04.641
RIGHT.

00:05:04.642 --> 00:05:06.042
REPUBLICANS JUST DON'T REGISTER

00:05:06.043 --> 00:05:06.543
ON IT.

00:05:06.544 --> 00:05:08.645
THEY DON'T WANT TO SEEM TO

00:05:08.646 --> 00:05:11.181
ACKNOWLEDGE THAT THERE'S ANY

00:05:11.182 --> 00:05:11.514
