&gt;&gt; Juan: HERE'S THE THING, TOP

00:05:34.305 --> 00:05:36.005
PRIORITY FOR DEMOCRATIC VOTERS,

00:05:36.006 --> 00:05:37.574
HEALTH CARE, NUMBER TWO FAR

00:05:37.575 --> 00:05:39.375
BEHIND BUT STILL NUMBER TWO.

