&gt;&gt; Juan: I DON'T THINK SO.

00:05:55.125 --> 00:05:56.759
I THINK THESE ARE PEOPLE WHO

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:58.828
THINK THIS IS GOING TO IMPACT ME

00:05:58.829 --> 00:05:59.629
IN MY LIFETIME AND I DON'T LIKE

00:05:59.630 --> 00:05:59.896
