00:05:59.897 --> 00:06:03.566
SO YOU GET JOE BIDEN --

00:06:03.567 --> 00:06:05.468
&gt;&gt; Kennedy: BE MORE POSITIVE.

00:06:05.469 --> 00:06:06.636
STOP BEING DOOMSDAY.

