00:07:05.129 --> 00:07:06.229
&gt;&gt; Greg: THAT IS SO TRUE.

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:07.263
&gt;&gt; Juan: WE HAVE TO SET THE

00:07:07.264 --> 00:07:07.931
